  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div style='text-align:Left;'><p>This data set is intended to reflect lands that were sold or transferred by the Crown and are not managed under the mandate of the Ministry of Natural Resources. &nbsp;It may include lands now in title to other:</p><ul><li>provincial or federal government agencies</li><li>municipal governments</li><li>mining patents (surface rights may still be held by the Crown)</li></ul><p>It is categorized based on:</p><ul><li>Geographic Township and a/Area</li><li>title holder&nbsp;</li><li>forestry rights</li></ul><div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Land-Tenure-Data-User-Guide-FINAL-20260415_ENG.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Land Tenure Data - User Guide (Word)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/DD%20Patent%20Land%20External%20(PTNLDEXT)%20(2026-04-01).docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Data Dictionary (Word)</a></li></ul></div><p><strong>Status:&nbsp;</strong><br />On going: data is continually being updated</p><p><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency:</strong><br />Continually</p><div><strong>Contact</strong></div><div>Ministry of Natural Resources, Office of the Surveyor General</div><ul><li><div><a href='mailto:landtenuremapping@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>landtenuremapping@ontario.ca</a>&nbsp;</div></li></ul></div>"
